msgid "从源码构建"
msgstr "Building from source"

msgid "宿主条件"
msgstr "Host requirements"

msgid ""
"使用 Linux/WSL、GNU Make 4.3+ 和仓库指定的 Clang/LLVM 工具链。 Clang 必须包含 x86_64 "
"compiler-rt builtins。典型 Debian/Ubuntu 依赖为::"
msgstr ""
"Use Linux/WSL, GNU Make 4.3+, and the Clang/LLVM toolchain specified by "
"the repository. Clang must include x86_64 compiler-rt builtins. Typical "
"Debian/Ubuntu dependencies are::"

msgid ""
"HTML 文档另需 Sphinx，见 :doc:`../process/documentation`。Sphinx 仅服务文档； "
"内核和用户态生产编译不因此改用 Python、Meson 或 Ninja。"
msgstr ""
"HTML documentation also requires Sphinx; see "
":doc:`../process/documentation`. Sphinx is used only for documentation; "
"production kernel and userspace builds do not switch to Python, Meson, or"
" Ninja as a result."

msgid ""
"``make test-build`` 中的播放器宿主检查另需 ``ffmpeg``、``libavformat-dev``、 "
"``libavcodec-dev``、``libavutil-dev``、``libswresample-dev`` 和 "
"``libswscale-dev``。 这些是宿主检查依赖；生产播放器使用锁定源码构建的 musl 库。 自启动的宿主检查另需 "
"``libglib2.0-dev``；生产程序使用锁定 APK 提供的目标 GIO 库和头文件。 可通过 "
"``PLAYER_TARGET_BUILD=/绝对路径/out/x86_64/release sh tests/build/test-"
"reliefplayer-mp4.sh`` 在 Linux 宿主上同时运行实际精简库和 musl 版本的解码/控制检查；这不等于来宾播放验证。"
msgstr ""
"The host-side player checks in ``make test-build`` also require "
"``ffmpeg``, ``libavformat-dev``, ``libavcodec-dev``, ``libavutil-dev``, "
"``libswresample-dev``, and ``libswscale-dev``. These are host-check "
"dependencies; the production player uses musl libraries built from pinned"
" sources. Autostart host checks also require ``libglib2.0-dev``. The "
"production application uses the target GIO library and headers supplied "
"by pinned APKs. Run ``PLAYER_TARGET_BUILD=/绝对路径/out/x86_64/release sh "
"tests/build/test-reliefplayer-mp4.sh`` on a Linux host to check decoding "
"and controls with both the actual reduced libraries and their musl "
"builds; this does not constitute guest playback validation."

msgid "构建顺序"
msgstr "Build order"

msgid "在 ReliefOS 仓库根目录执行::"
msgstr "Run from the ReliefOS repository root::"

msgid ""
"根 Makefile 是受支持入口。fetch 是显式联网阶段，按锁文件校验摘要； "
"内核缓存独立。普通构建缺缓存应报错，不暗中下载。第三方保留自己的上游构建系统。 源码与公开头从各自所有者导出，不从历史 build 目录补齐。"
msgstr ""
"The root Makefile is the supported entry point. Fetching is an explicit "
"network stage that verifies digests against the lockfile; the kernel has "
"a separate cache. A normal build must fail if its cache is missing, "
"without silently downloading anything. Third-party projects retain their "
"upstream build systems. Sources and public headers are exported by their "
"respective owners, not recovered from old build directories."

msgid "配置内核"
msgstr "Configuring the kernel"

msgid ""
"``make defconfig`` 有序重置 ReliefOS 与 ReliefNT 的默认配置。内核输出默认 在 "
"``O/reliefnt``；``RELIEFNT_O=`` 可指定另一输出目录，相对路径从调用 顶层 make "
"的目录解析。默认将生产部件内置；普通构建及 OS 的 ``olddefconfig`` 不重置已有内核选择。"
msgstr ""
"``make defconfig`` resets the ReliefOS and ReliefNT default "
"configurations in order. Kernel output defaults to ``O/reliefnt``; "
"``RELIEFNT_O=`` selects another output directory, with relative paths "
"resolved from the directory where top-level make is invoked. Production "
"components are built in by default; normal builds and the OS "
"``olddefconfig`` do not reset existing kernel selections."

msgid "用以下目标编辑同一内核输出的配置::"
msgstr "Use these targets to edit the configuration for the same kernel output::"

msgid ""
"前者打开 ReliefNT 原生菜单，第二个保留已有选择并解析新增选项，第三个将 支持独立模块的部件选为 ``m``。内核与 OS "
"分别持有配置，应用、镜像和 QEMU 选项继续在 OS 菜单中配置。仅已完成运行时边界的部件才提供 ``m``。"
msgstr ""
"The first opens the native ReliefNT menu, the second preserves existing "
"selections and resolves new options, and the third selects ``m`` for "
"components that support standalone modules. The kernel and OS maintain "
"separate configurations; application, image, and QEMU options remain in "
"the OS menu. Only components with completed runtime boundaries offer "
"``m``."

msgid "增量与排错"
msgstr "Incremental builds and troubleshooting"

msgid ""
"用 ``V=1`` 查看命令，``make --trace`` 查看依赖，``make -n`` 预览。 首次预览产品前先执行 defconfig"
"、config-sync。同一 O 互斥，不伪造内部锁 token； 不同 O 可并行。原版 Kbuild 的 .cmd 与 fixdep "
"跟踪命令、源码和头文件依赖。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``V=1`` to show commands, ``make --trace`` to inspect dependencies, "
"and ``make -n`` for a preview. Run defconfig and config-sync before the "
"first product preview. Builds using the same O are mutually exclusive; do"
" not forge internal lock tokens. Different O directories may build in "
"parallel. Upstream Kbuild's .cmd files and fixdep track commands, source "
"files, and header dependencies."

msgid "clean 保留配置；distclean 同时清配置。它们只清有所有权标记的输出树， 不删除共享下载缓存或用户旧镜像。"
msgstr ""
"clean preserves configuration; distclean removes it as well. They clean "
"only output trees with ownership markers and do not delete shared "
"download caches or users' old images."

